    {
      "id": 92,
      "user_id": 9,
      "date": "2026-08-04",
      "client_name": "Navayuga Engineering Company Ltd",
      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-04\",\"text\":\"HDFC has cleared the name of NECL  \\\"Mr. Ashok Maniyar, Sr. VP, Large corporate, HDFC bank, Hyderabad told that they are not very keen on Infra proposals but asked the amount of FB and NFB limit required by Navayuga. Mr. Ashok said they are more keen on FB limit. To followup with Navayuga. \\\" ( To speak Sahni)\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"HDFC has cleared the name of NECL, Mr. Ashok Maniyar, Sr. VP, Large corporate, HDFC bank, Hyderabad told that they are not very keen on Infra proposals but asked the amount of FB and NFB limit required by Navayuga. Mr. Ashok said they are more keen on FB limit. To followup with Navayuga. ( To speak Sahni)\\\"I spoke to Mr. Arpit Jhawar, Cluster Head, HDFC bank, Hyderabad today, 6th April for Navayuga status….Arpit said that he has assigned Mr. Ajay Verghese, RM for Navayuga proposal today and Ajay will make the Proposal Note and will revert to us if any requirement is there. Arpit said that he will share the contact number of Mr. Ajay Verghese with us shortly, Mr. Arpit also told that once In-principle clearance is given by credit team then the HDFC bank other team will release the Navayuga account to them(Mr. Arpit Jhawar). I just spoke to Mr. Arpit Jhawar, Cluster Head, HDFC Bank, Hyderabad regarding the meeting. He mentioned that he is currently busy due to a medical issue with his wife and may resume office from Monday, 22nd June. Arpit informed that the discussion between Mr. Gopal Bhargava and Regional Credit Head, Mr. Shankar is to be done internally, most likely next week. After that meeting, we will know the outcome. (I spoke to Mr Jatin Arora,  Circle Head, HDFC Bank,  Hyderabad for meeting...Jatin said he is in Kedarnath and is on leave and will resume office on 23rd June and after joining he will revert to us for Navayuga status.  He assured that as soon as the meeting happens, he will revert to us with feedback.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"I and Sandeep called Mr. Arpit on 3rd August 2026 for Navayuga status…Mr. Arpit didn’t pick the call and sent msg to me: \\\"Sir give some time, I will call you in evening.\\\"\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"text\":\"I met with Mr. Raveendra Sahni, HDFC bank on 20th August 2026….Mr. Sahni told that they had internal discussion once, and few more discussion will take place, and it will take some time. Mr. Sahni told that he will revert once there is any progress on Navayuga.\"}]",
