      "client_name": "Navayuga Engineering Company Ltd",
      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"VC of Mr. Sumeet, Navayuga and Euro Exim Bank(Mr. Senthil Kumar and Mr. Chaitanya Prabhu) has been done on 9th January 2026 for Navayuga amount refund. Mr. Senthil, Euro Exim Bank asked Sumeet to send reminder email to info@euroeximbank.com and then Euro Exim bank, UK team will respond to the email.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"Proposal shared by Mihir with Ambrish on 22nd April  Navyuga Exim arranged a meeting between Sumit, Amrish, and Navjot. Amrish requested details regarding fund utilization. We suggested that Sumit identify projects from the past year where reimbursement can be claimed. Additionally, we advised showing retention money as long-term working capital, to be received over the next three years, Exim bank is not accepting the End use. Sandeep spoke to Mr. Sumeet, Navayuga….Sumeet said give me some time and he will work out some other End use.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-06\",\"text\":\"To follow up with Exim Bank for status.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"text\":\"To followup with Exim Bank for status.\"}]",
