      "date": "2026-08-05",
      "client_name": "Shree Naman Group",
      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"I met with Mr. Bibhuti Bhusan, HDFC bank, Pune on 25th March 2026 for Shree Naman - Pavana proposal. Mr. Bibhuti said they have given the proposal to Real Estate team in HDFC bank, Mumbai. Bibhuti said that due to year end, Real estate team will not be able to take up the proposal now and said in 2nd week of April they will revert. I asked Bibhuti to share the concern person name and contact details in Real estate team, Mumbai...but Bibhuti didnt gave the name and said he will arrange our meeting with the concern person in Real Estate team in Mumbai in 2nd week of April, as all are busy in year end closing.  Note: Bibhuti told that he himself and Real estate team, Mumbai will jointly work on the Shree Naman - Pavana proposal.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-12\",\"text\":\"Term sheet received.\"},{\"date\":\"2026-08-24\",\"text\":\"Proposal sent to Bibhuti bhusan\"}]",
