      "id": 138,
      "user_id": 9,
      "date": "2026-08-05",
      "client_name": "Cybercity Builders and Developers Pvt Ltd",
      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-05\",\"text\":\"Vizag Project 1  *1. Iconica City of Gold* This project is being developed under Iconica City LLP, where Garden City holds a 50% stake and KMKL Developers Limited holds the remaining 50%. Within KMKL Developers, Murali Krishna and his son each hold equal (50:50) shareholding. * The project is a villa development spread across 11 lakh sq. ft. * Total project cost is approximately ₹550 crore, with a sale price of ₹10,000 per sq. ft., generating an estimated surplus of ₹550 crore. * Existing debt includes ₹65 crore from Excess Finance and ₹95 crore from Piramal, totaling ₹160 crore (takeover required). * An additional ₹100 crore in construction finance is required, bringing the total funding requirement to ₹260 crore. This mandate has been taken for Jio Credit, and we need to check their interest in funding a project in Vizag.\"}]",
      "status": "in_progress",
      "priority": "medium",
      "notes": "Update on 29/06/26",
      "created_at": "2026-08-05 12:41:12",
