      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"text\":\"I met with Mr. Rohit Gupta, regional head Indusind bank Hyderabad on 22nd May 2026 for Navayuga. Mr. Rohit said that he has got one deal from JP morgan for 1700-1800cr and they are evaluating for 50 to 100cr only. Rohit said that it is in initial stage only and they have not sent the proposal to Credit yet.  I told Rohit that we have given you Navayuga proposal from last 1 year..but you didn't take up and now you are doing through JP Morgan...Rohit said that it has come from top management and he can't ignore it. Rohit said still he is not confident that this deal will go through. Rohit said if they do term loan then he will do working capital of Navayuga through us.\"}]",
