      "task_description": "[{\"date\":\"2026-08-21\",\"text\":\"Meeting of Mr. Deepak Pothan, Jio Credit and Gardencity (Mr. Murali Krishna, Mr. Ashish Bhasin and Mr. Boilla Murali) has been done on 18th August 2026 in Bengaluru. Mr. Deepak Pothan said that he will discuss internally and will revert by Friday, 21st August. Mr. Murali suggested to Mr. Deepak that you can do 120cr proposal (refinancing of Axis finance of 60cr and additional 60cr)....Mr. Deepak said ok. Sandeep and Pankaj called Mr. Deepak Pothan today, 21st August...but Deepak didn't pick the call. I have sent msg to Mr. Deepak.\"}]",
